{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "铁三角决定忍辱留下  (The Iron Trio Chooses to Stay and Fight)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Reporting back to Kaiwen and Xingzi, Bu Xiaogu warns that Xie Ling intends to replace Xingtian's original slate with imported British formats, burying Chun Yuqiao's travel show for good. Listen to their Mandarin pact first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢灵要把全英式的制作流程引入星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "意外吗？他手里握着大把英国节目的版权，一个接一个在星天立项。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要是这样下去的话，魅力远航不只要延播，更是没有出头之日了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其他新的原创节目，那就更别提了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "魅力远航如果没有延播，现在早就掀起原创热了，老大努力了那么久。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我探清楚了，谢灵暂时是踢不走我的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是总编室的铁三角要是没了，我一个人可干不成事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，杏子姐，你们愿不愿意屈尊，一起再留一段时间？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，你的意思是让我们俩放弃跳槽的机会，放弃高薪水和高职位？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "在谢灵的屋檐底下低头，直到有一天被他给开了，是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行，我们留下来陪你干！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没错，咱们铁三角绝不散伙。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢灵要把全英式的制作流程引入星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xie Ling plans to bring an entirely British production workflow into Xingtian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "意外吗？他手里握着大把英国节目的版权，一个接一个在星天立项。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is that any surprise? He holds stacks of British format rights to greenlight one after another at Xingtian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要是这样下去的话，魅力远航不只要延播，更是没有出头之日了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If things go down that road, Charming Voyage will not merely be delayed—it will never see the light of day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其他新的原创节目，那就更别提了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And as for any other new original shows, you can forget about them altogether.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "魅力远航如果没有延播，现在早就掀起原创热了，老大努力了那么久。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Had Charming Voyage not been delayed, it would already have sparked an original-format boom after all the boss's hard work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我探清楚了，谢灵暂时是踢不走我的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I sounded him out clearly, and Xie Ling will not be kicking me out for now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是总编室的铁三角要是没了，我一个人可干不成事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet if the editorial office loses its iron trio, I can never pull this off alone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，杏子姐，你们愿不愿意屈尊，一起再留一段时间？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Brother Kaiwen, Sister Xingzi, would you be willing to swallow your pride and stay a while longer together?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，你的意思是让我们俩放弃跳槽的机会，放弃高薪水和高职位？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, are you asking the two of us to give up headhunter offers, high salaries, and senior titles?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "在谢灵的屋檐底下低头，直到有一天被他给开了，是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And bow our heads under Xie Ling's roof until the day he fires us, is that right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行，我们留下来陪你干！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Deal—we will stay right here and fight alongside you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没错，咱们铁三角绝不散伙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is right, our iron trio is not breaking up.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢灵要把全英式的制作流程引入星天。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "意外吗？他手里握着大把英国节目的版权，一个接一个在星天立项。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要是这样下去的话，魅力远航不只要延播，更是没有出头之日了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其他新的原创节目，那就更别提了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "魅力远航如果没有延播，现在早就掀起原创热了，老大努力了那么久。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我探清楚了，谢灵暂时是踢不走我的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是总编室的铁三角要是没了，我一个人可干不成事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，杏子姐，你们愿不愿意屈尊，一起再留一段时间？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，你的意思是让我们俩放弃跳槽的机会，放弃高薪水和高职位？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "在谢灵的屋檐底下低头，直到有一天被他给开了，是吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行，我们留下来陪你干！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没错，咱们铁三角绝不散伙。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Putting loyalty to Chun Yuqiao's dream ahead of triple-salary headhunter offers, Kaiwen and Xingzi agree on the spot to stay beside Xiaogu and defend original programming. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
